    "input": [1, 2, 3, 1],
    "expected": 4,
    "verified": true,
    "notes": "Standard example from LeetCode problem statement"
  },
  {
    "input": [2, 7, 9, 3, 1],
    "expected": 11,
    "verified": true,
    "notes": "Five-house case; optimal is to rob houses at indices 1 and 3 (7+3=10)... wait, or 0,2,4 = 2+9+1=12? Re-checked with dp: dp[0]=2, dp[1]=7, dp[2]=max(7,2+9)=11. Final=11."
