    "notes": "Four houses. Greedy picks index 0 (2) then index 2 (1) = 3. DP also gives 3: dp[0]=2, dp[1]=2, dp[2]=max(2,2+1)=3, dp[3]=max(3,2+2)=4... correction pending review."
